Package: CKMHEOR
Title: Cost-Effectiveness Model for Cardiovascular-Kidney-Metabolic Syndrome
Version: 0.5.0
Description: Analysis project built on the WARDEN discrete event simulation
    engine. Not an installable package: this file lists the R packages the
    model needs so that GitHub Actions can install them. preventr is installed
    separately at a pinned version (.github/actions/setup-ckm).
Imports:
    WARDEN,
    data.table,
    ggplot2,
    MASS,
    flexsurv,
    dplyr,
    scales
